{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/21feaa7f7663f3cba010145aa3dbf36d.avif?t=1771088600\" width=462 height=220 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mayor Life Simulator \u2014 Are You Ready to Be the Mayor?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a dangerous yet thrilling journey from the quiet streets of Ricano to the sunny shores of Mayorica! Mayor Life Simulator combines gang wars, high-speed action, assassination missions, car chases, and a completely free open-world experience all in one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life isn't going so well... until Arthur calls you with an offer that will change your destiny. To get started, just collect the money, buy the ticket, and step into Mayorica. There, a brand-new life awaits you, complete with a free home, cars, and dangerous missions. You have one goal: to become Mayor of Mayorica City! Experience the ultimate mayoral simulation, the first of its kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Open World Freedom:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roam a vast map, drive cars, explore, and write your own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/38a4f49ecfddfc78cf53232f418ff745.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/38a4f49ecfddfc78cf53232f418ff745.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/38a4f49ecfddfc78cf53232f418ff745.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Guns &amp; Gang Wars:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battle dangerous gangs, make deadly decisions on missions. Each mission brings greater risk... but greater reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/e34320fdb01e47864992cf91f7cd1113.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/e34320fdb01e47864992cf91f7cd1113.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/e34320fdb01e47864992cf91f7cd1113.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Driving Experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Speed through the streets, engage in chases, and become the ruler of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/5785d2eee6c03ced80c2445c9d734a4f.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/5785d2eee6c03ced80c2445c9d734a4f.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/5785d2eee6c03ced80c2445c9d734a4f.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run the Gun Shop:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy and manage a gun shop. Sell weapons, expand your inventory, take risks. Accept or decline secret missions. Choose your path. Combine trade with action, grow your profits and reputation; become the city's most powerful arms dealer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/f3df982c9070fcab3a784e9f3726a31b.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/f3df982c9070fcab3a784e9f3726a31b.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/f3df982c9070fcab3a784e9f3726a31b.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mayor:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bring gangs to heel, win the support of the people, find your way in a world of bribery, and ultimately become the city's mayor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Decisions Are Yours:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go to court, perform marriages, accept or reject bribes... In this city, what you say goes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3834340?t=1771088600","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/67e7ef8d3707ef78b02226907c193919db490bea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771088600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/e6dbd61578d320f83491b0c7f9bfad74070c8ee6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771088600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/e6dbd61578d320f83491b0c7f9bfa