ate mayoral simulation, the first of its kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Open World Freedom:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Roam a vast map, drive cars, explore, and write your own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/38a4f49ecfddfc78cf53232f418ff745.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/38a4f49ecfddfc78cf53232f418ff745.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/38a4f49ecfddfc78cf53232f418ff745.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Guns &amp; Gang Wars:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Battle dangerous gangs, make deadly decisions on missions. Each mission brings greater risk... but greater reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/e34320fdb01e47864992cf91f7cd1113.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/e34320fdb01e47864992cf91f7cd1113.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/e34320fdb01e47864992cf91f7cd1113.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Driving Experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Speed through the streets, engage in chases, and become the ruler of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/5785d2eee6c03ced80c2445c9d734a4f.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/5785d2eee6c03ced80c2445c9d734a4f.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/5785d2eee6c03ced80c2445c9d734a4f.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run the Gun Shop:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Buy and manage a gun shop. Sell weapons, expand your inventory, take risks. Accept or decline secret missions. Choose your path. Combine trade with action, grow your profits and reputation; become the city's most powerful arms dealer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/f3df982c9070fcab3a784e9f3726a31b.poster.avif?t=1771088600\" width=1170 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/f3df982c9070fcab3a784e9f3726a31b.webm?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834340/extras/f3df982c9070fcab3a784e9f3726a31b.mp4?t=1771088600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mayor:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bring gangs to heel, win the support of the people, find your way in a world of bribery, and 